{"seq":3,"slug":"stylization-consistency","title":"风格化处理与视觉一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/color-grading-theory/stylization-consistency","wordCount":1632,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"风格化处理与视觉一致性\">风格化处理与视觉一致性</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>风格化处理（Stylization）是从&quot;正确的色彩&quot;走向&quot;有意义的色彩&quot;的创作过程——它将调色从技术校正升级为艺术表达。但风格化最大的挑战不是&quot;做出一张好看的&quot;，而是<strong>保持一组画面的视觉一致性</strong>。无论是一组照片集、一部短片还是一个品牌的视觉系统，一致性是专业感的核心标志。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Stylization&lt;br/&gt;风格化处理&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Look Development&lt;br/&gt;Look 开发&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Consistency&lt;br/&gt;一致性维护&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Adaptation&lt;br/&gt;场景适应&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;Reference Analysis&lt;br/&gt;参考分析&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;Parameter Design&lt;br/&gt;参数设计&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[&quot;Testing&lt;br/&gt;测试验证&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;LUT/Preset&lt;br/&gt;统一工具&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;Scope Monitoring&lt;br/&gt;示波器监控&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;Skin Tone Anchor&lt;br/&gt;肤色锚定&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;Scene Variation&lt;br/&gt;场景差异&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;Lighting Change&lt;br/&gt;光线变化&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[&quot;Color Drift&lt;br/&gt;色彩漂移&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Stylization&lt;br/&gt;风格化处理\"] --&gt; B[\"Look Development&lt;br/&gt;Look 开发\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Consistency&lt;br/&gt;一致性维护\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Adaptation&lt;br/&gt;场景适应\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"Reference Analysis&lt;br/&gt;参考分析\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"Parameter Design&lt;br/&gt;参数设计\"]\n    B --&gt; B3[\"Testing&lt;br/&gt;测试验证\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"LUT/Preset&lt;br/&gt;统一工具\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"Scope Monitoring&lt;br/&gt;示波器监控\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"Skin Tone Anchor&lt;br/&gt;肤色锚定\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"Scene Variation&lt;br/&gt;场景差异\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"Lighting Change&lt;br/&gt;光线变化\"]\n    D --&gt; D3[\"Color Drift&lt;br/&gt;色彩漂移\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>风格化处理真正的难点是&quot;一组画面像同一个世界&quot;，其核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Look 与 Grade 分层</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最终画面</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>技术校正</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Look（全局不变）</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Grade（逐场景微调）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最终画面} = \\text{技术校正} + \\text{Look（全局不变）} + \\text{Grade（逐场景微调）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最终画面</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">技术校正</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Look</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（全局不变）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Grade</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（逐场景微调）</span></span></span></span></span></span>，把全片基调与场景适应分开。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性按层次区分要求</strong>：技术底层每帧可变，对比结构场景组内统一，色调方向与饱和度映射要求全片统一。</li>\n<li><strong>肤色是最敏感的锚点</strong>：健康肤色矢量角约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>123</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo>±</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">123° \\pm 10°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">123°</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10°</span></span></span></span></span>（NTSC），观者对肤色异常的感知阈值极低，因此肤色是检验一致性的第一指标。</li>\n<li><strong>示波器让一致性可验证</strong>：波形图、RGB Parade、矢量示波器分别监控亮度、色温/色调、色相/饱和度，把&quot;看起来一致&quot;变成&quot;测得一致&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"风格化的层次结构\">风格化的层次结构</h2><h3 id=\"从底层到顶层\">从底层到顶层</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>可变性</th>\n<th>一致性要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>技术底层</td>\n<td>曝光/白平衡/降噪</td>\n<td>每帧不同</td>\n<td>低（适应场景）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对比结构</td>\n<td>S曲线形状/黑位/白位</td>\n<td>场景组内统一</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色调方向</td>\n<td>色调分离/整体色偏</td>\n<td>全片统一</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和度映射</td>\n<td>各色相饱和度策略</td>\n<td>全片统一</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特效层</td>\n<td>颗粒/暗角/光晕</td>\n<td>全片统一</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"look-vs-grade-的区别\">Look vs Grade 的区别</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>一致性角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Look</td>\n<td>整体视觉风格（创意方向）</td>\n<td>全片不变的基调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grade</td>\n<td>逐镜头/逐场景的具体调整</td>\n<td>适应场景的微调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shot Match</td>\n<td>同场景不同镜头的匹配</td>\n<td>剪辑点不跳色</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最终画面</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>技术校正</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Look（全局）</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Grade（局部）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最终画面} = \\text{技术校正} + \\text{Look（全局）} + \\text{Grade（局部）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最终画面</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">技术校正</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Look</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（全局）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Grade</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（局部）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"look-开发流程\">Look 开发流程</h2><h3 id=\"系统化-look-开发\">系统化 Look 开发</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>产出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 定义意图</td>\n<td>明确情绪/故事/受众</td>\n<td>文字描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 收集参考</td>\n<td>电影帧/摄影作品/绘画</td>\n<td>情绪板 (Moodboard)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 分析参考</td>\n<td>量化参考的色彩参数</td>\n<td>参数清单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 构建基础</td>\n<td>设定核心参数</td>\n<td>基础 LUT/节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. 多场景测试</td>\n<td>不同光线/内容测试</td>\n<td>一致性验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6. 迭代修正</td>\n<td>解决特定场景问题</td>\n<td>改进版 Look</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7. 固化交付</td>\n<td>打包为可分享的格式</td>\n<td>LUT + 说明文档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"参考分析的量化方法\">参考分析的量化方法</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Reference Frame&lt;br/&gt;参考帧&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Histogram&lt;br/&gt;直方图分析&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Vectorscope&lt;br/&gt;矢量图分析&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;RGB Parade&lt;br/&gt;RGB 分量&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;对比度结构&lt;br/&gt;黑位/白位/分布&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;色调偏向&lt;br/&gt;主色相/饱和度范围&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;通道平衡&lt;br/&gt;RGB 相对关系&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Reference Frame&lt;br/&gt;参考帧\"] --&gt; B[\"Histogram&lt;br/&gt;直方图分析\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Vectorscope&lt;br/&gt;矢量图分析\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"RGB Parade&lt;br/&gt;RGB 分量\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"对比度结构&lt;br/&gt;黑位/白位/分布\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"色调偏向&lt;br/&gt;主色相/饱和度范围\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"通道平衡&lt;br/&gt;RGB 相对关系\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分析维度</th>\n<th>测量工具</th>\n<th>提取信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整体明度</td>\n<td>直方图</td>\n<td>低调/中调/高调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对比度</td>\n<td>直方图宽度</td>\n<td>高/中/低对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色温</td>\n<td>RGB Parade 平衡</td>\n<td>暖/冷倾向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色调分离</td>\n<td>矢量示波器</td>\n<td>暗部/亮部偏向角度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和度</td>\n<td>矢量范围</td>\n<td>饱和度整体水平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肤色线</td>\n<td>矢量肤色线</td>\n<td>肤色偏离程度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"视觉一致性维护\">视觉一致性维护</h2><h3 id=\"一致性的敌人\">一致性的敌人</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>不一致来源</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>发生频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光线变化</td>\n<td>室内/室外/时段切换</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相机差异</td>\n<td>多机位色彩特性不同</td>\n<td>高（多机项目）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镜头差异</td>\n<td>不同镜头色偏/暗角</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场景色彩差异</td>\n<td>不同场景主色调变化</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后期操作差异</td>\n<td>不同时间/心情调色不同</td>\n<td>中（人为因素）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"肤色锚定策略\">肤色锚定策略</h3><p>肤色是视觉一致性最敏感的指标——观者对肤色异常的感知阈值极低：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>健康肤色矢量角</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>123</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>（NTSC 矢量示波器）</mtext><mo>±</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{健康肤色矢量角} \\approx 123°（\\text{NTSC 矢量示波器}）\\pm 10°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">健康肤色矢量角</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">123°</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NTSC </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">矢量示波器</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10°</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>肤色状态</th>\n<th>矢量位置</th>\n<th>感知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常健康</td>\n<td>肤色线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 5°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">5°</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>自然</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻微偏黄</td>\n<td>偏向黄 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>–</mtext><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5°–10°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5°–10°</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可接受（暖调）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏绿</td>\n<td>偏向绿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 10°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10°</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>病态感（极不自然）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏品红</td>\n<td>偏向品红 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 10°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10°</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>醉酒感/过红</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"示波器驱动的一致性\">示波器驱动的一致性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>示波器</th>\n<th>监控内容</th>\n<th>一致性用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>波形（Waveform）</td>\n<td>亮度分布</td>\n<td>确保曝光/对比一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RGB Parade</td>\n<td>三通道分别</td>\n<td>确保色温/色调一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矢量示波器</td>\n<td>色相/饱和度</td>\n<td>确保色调偏向一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直方图</td>\n<td>整体分布</td>\n<td>快速对比两帧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"场景适应策略\">场景适应策略</h2><h3 id=\"不同光线条件下维持-look\">不同光线条件下维持 Look</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景变化</th>\n<th>适应策略</th>\n<th>不变的部分</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日光→阴天</td>\n<td>调整基础曝光/WB</td>\n<td>Look 色调分离保持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>室内→室外</td>\n<td>重新平衡对比</td>\n<td>饱和度映射保持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日景→夜景</td>\n<td>整体压暗+调对比</td>\n<td>色相偏向保持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暖光→冷光</td>\n<td>WB 校正后再应用 Look</td>\n<td>Look 参数不变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分组管理\">分组管理</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>项目</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>Scene Group</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>每组共享一个基础 Grade</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{项目} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\text{Scene Group}_i, \\quad \\text{每组共享一个基础 Grade}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">项目</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Scene Group</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每组共享一个基础</span><span class=\"mord\"> Grade</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分组依据</th>\n<th>组内策略</th>\n<th>组间策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相同光线</td>\n<td>同一基础参数</td>\n<td>微调过渡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相同地点</td>\n<td>共享 Grade</td>\n<td>切换平滑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相同时间</td>\n<td>同一色温/曝光</td>\n<td>时间过渡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相同机位</td>\n<td>消除设备差异</td>\n<td>统一基准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"特效层的一致性\">特效层的一致性</h2><h3 id=\"胶片颗粒-film-grain\">胶片颗粒（Film Grain）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>一致性规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>颗粒大小</td>\n<td>全片统一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颗粒强度</td>\n<td>全片统一或按暗部/亮部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颗粒颜色</td>\n<td>彩色/单色——全片选一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分辨率适配</td>\n<td>4K 颗粒 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\neq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span></span> 1080p 颗粒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"暗角-vignette\">暗角（Vignette）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> ~ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> EV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围</td>\n<td>画面边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>–</mtext><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%–35\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%–35%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>形状</td>\n<td>椭圆（匹配画幅比例）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>全片统一（不因场景改变）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"跨媒介一致性\">跨媒介一致性</h2><h3 id=\"同一风格在不同输出中的维护\">同一风格在不同输出中的维护</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Master Grade&lt;br/&gt;主调色&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Social Media&lt;br/&gt;社交媒体&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Print&lt;br/&gt;打印&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;HDR Display&lt;br/&gt;HDR显示&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;Web Gallery&lt;br/&gt;网络画廊&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;sRGB 转换&lt;br/&gt;饱和度微调&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;CMYK 软打样&lt;br/&gt;对比补偿&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;HDR Trim Pass&lt;br/&gt;HDR适配&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;嵌入Profile&lt;br/&gt;浏览器兼容&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Master Grade&lt;br/&gt;主调色\"] --&gt; B[\"Social Media&lt;br/&gt;社交媒体\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Print&lt;br/&gt;打印\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"HDR Display&lt;br/&gt;HDR显示\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"Web Gallery&lt;br/&gt;网络画廊\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"sRGB 转换&lt;br/&gt;饱和度微调\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"CMYK 软打样&lt;br/&gt;对比补偿\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"HDR Trim Pass&lt;br/&gt;HDR适配\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"嵌入Profile&lt;br/&gt;浏览器兼容\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输出目标</th>\n<th>风格适配</th>\n<th>关键调整</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Instagram</td>\n<td>加对比/微加饱和</td>\n<td>补偿手机屏环境光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打印</td>\n<td>暗部提亮/高光压缩</td>\n<td>纸张动态范围有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HDR 显示</td>\n<td>高光扩展/暗部保持</td>\n<td>利用 HDR 优势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投影</td>\n<td>加亮/加对比</td>\n<td>投影环境亮度损失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>风格化处理的最高境界不是&quot;一张照片好看&quot;，而是<strong>一系列画面形成统一的视觉语言</strong>——观者即使看不出具体参数，也能感受到&quot;这些画面属于同一个世界&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>一致性层次</th>\n<th>实现手段</th>\n<th>检验方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>色调方向</td>\n<td>LUT/色调分离固定</td>\n<td>矢量示波器对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对比结构</td>\n<td>曲线/S型固定</td>\n<td>波形图对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和度</td>\n<td>HSL 映射固定</td>\n<td>矢量范围对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肤色</td>\n<td>肤色线监控</td>\n<td>矢量示波器 123°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特效</td>\n<td>颗粒/暗角参数统一</td>\n<td>视觉 A/B 对比</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"风格化处理与视觉一致性","id":"风格化处理与视觉一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"风格化的层次结构","id":"风格化的层次结构"},{"level":3,"text":"从底层到顶层","id":"从底层到顶层"},{"level":3,"text":"Look vs Grade 的区别","id":"look-vs-grade-的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"Look 开发流程","id":"look-开发流程"},{"level":3,"text":"系统化 Look 开发","id":"系统化-look-开发"},{"level":3,"text":"参考分析的量化方法","id":"参考分析的量化方法"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉一致性维护","id":"视觉一致性维护"},{"level":3,"text":"一致性的敌人","id":"一致性的敌人"},{"level":3,"text":"肤色锚定策略","id":"肤色锚定策略"},{"level":3,"text":"示波器驱动的一致性","id":"示波器驱动的一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"场景适应策略","id":"场景适应策略"},{"level":3,"text":"不同光线条件下维持 Look","id":"不同光线条件下维持-look"},{"level":3,"text":"分组管理","id":"分组管理"},{"level":2,"text":"特效层的一致性","id":"特效层的一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"胶片颗粒（Film Grain）","id":"胶片颗粒-film-grain"},{"level":3,"text":"暗角（Vignette）","id":"暗角-vignette"},{"level":2,"text":"跨媒介一致性","id":"跨媒介一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"同一风格在不同输出中的维护","id":"同一风格在不同输出中的维护"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"调色方向与风格定义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/color-grading-theory/grading-direction"},"next":null}